  <Metadata>
    <Identity Language="en-US" Id="agile-analytics" Publisher="Baytek" Version="6.50.1"/>
    <DisplayName>Agile Analytics — Sprint Forecasting &amp; Flow Metrics for Azure DevOps</DisplayName>
    <Description xml:space="preserve">Know if your team will hit the sprint — and where the work goes. DORA metrics, exec reports, investment allocation &amp; 30+ analytics views for Azure DevOps. No PAT, no setup, no data sent to us.</Description>
    <GalleryFlags>Public</GalleryFlags>
    <Categories>Azure Boards,Azure Pipelines</Categories>
    <Tags>__DoNotDownload,agile,analytics,dashboard,insights,sprint,sprint planning,next sprint planning,velocity,cycle time,flow metrics,flow efficiency,service level expectations,monte carlo,wip,burndown,reporting,scrum,kanban,forecasting,team health,retrospective,dora,deployment frequency,lead time,change failure rate,investment allocation,executive report,sprint report,throughput,cumulative flow,capacity planning,engineering metrics,time to restore,predictability,sprint reporting,agile metrics,azure devops analytics,sprint analytics,team velocity</Tags>
